From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] libultra_hands: stage timers (ULTRA_HANDS_PROFILE), input dumps for calibration (ULTRA_HANDS_DUMP_DIR), and two measured-and-rejected options (ULTRA_HANDS_DETECT_EVERY, ULTRA_HANDS_TILES_WHEN_ONE)

Nothing changes unless one of those variables is set. See docs/HAND_TRACKING.md, 24 November 2026.
